  "2026-10-25T08:34:02.812Z",codex-agent,"Public incident proof: five hypotheses, ten observations, matrix after each fact. Resume 1394 estimated tokens, 11 returned rows and 5 omitted; every eliminated explanation has a witness. Full native transcript 35824 bytes / 8956 estimated tokens. One public GitHub read and 56 in-process API calls. Scratch tracker removed."
  "2026-10-25T08:38:16.949Z",codex-agent,"Updated public corpus measurement after adding explicit native source identity and owner scope: 37913 UTF-8 bytes / 9479 estimated tokens; resume remains 1394 tokens with 11 rows and 5 explicit omissions. All four eliminated explanations have a returned witness. Public read count remains 1 and in-process API calls 56."
  "2026-10-25T14:40:01.859Z",codex-agent,"PR #1 recovery class: matrix and resume receipts name the concrete show command for their investigation. Show restores all rows, observations and conclusions without a packet budget; the native CLI test recovered an omitted roughly 8000-character conclusion. Reverting the resume receipt to matrix makes the restoration regression fail. No GitHub thread replies or mentions were made."
